# The build context is the repository root; keep it small and secret-free.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Node — the console build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT for both compose
# and CI, so apps/console/.dockerignore was never read. Without these, a
# locally-developed tree copies host node_modules over the npm ci layer,
# producing an image whose dependencies were never resolved by the lockfile.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
.venv
venv
deploy/kubernetes
docs
*.md
